{"id":"0c57c9ec349151f1","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-real-substitution.md","title":"Substitution of a Computed Real","display":"thm-real-substitution — Substitution of a Computed Real","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-real-substitution","aliases":["68-thm-real-substitution"],"display":"thm-real-substitution — Substitution of a Computed Real","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-recursive-real-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§18.2 p.71 / PDF 80","verification_status":"source-adapted-theorem","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read-not-fully-reconstructed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-real-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-real-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-real-substitution — Substitution of a Computed Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" href=\"?note=f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-function\">68-df-recursive-real-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§18.2 p.71 / PDF 80"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-theorem"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read-not-fully-reconstructed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m+1,k)}\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m+1,k)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k+1)}\">\\(H\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k+1)}\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\">\\((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\)</span>，用下式引入一元偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\">\\(H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\)</span>。函数调用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" href=\"?note=f3126eb15a4d7bf1\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-function\">68-df-recursive-real-function</a>。实变量的替代槽为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的最后一个实输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}:=\\{(z,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle z\\rangle),y)\\in H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}:=\\{(z,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle z\\rangle),y)\\in H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\bigl(H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\in\\mathcal B\\Rightarrow F(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\simeq G(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\rangle,\\vec x)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\bigl(H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\in\\mathcal B\\Rightarrow F(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\simeq G(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\rangle,\\vec x)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 18.2，印刷 p.71 / PDF p.80，已经对照实际页面核对陈述和证明段。原书把待代入的实置于 G 的首个实槽，并将 H 的生成变量放在数变量前；这里仅用有限输入置换改写为目录统一的末槽约定。结论只限制 H 的该一元截面为全函数的输入；当截面不全时，F 仍可能收敛，不能把式子无条件延伸或断言 F 的定义域恰是这些输入。原书利用推广的 T 谓词给出证明；本次未补建该完整正常形机制，故不把阅读证明段等同于已独立重建全部证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-function","status":"resolved","id":"f3126eb15a4d7bf1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-function","status":"resolved","id":"f3126eb15a4d7bf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$G\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m+1,k)}$，$H\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k+1)}$。对 $(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}$，用下式引入一元偏函数 $H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}$。函数调用的 $\\simeq$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-real-function]]。实变量的替代槽为 $G$ 的最后一个实输入。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m+1,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}:=\\{(z,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle z\\rangle),y)\\in H\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{PartRecReal}^{(m,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;\\bigl(H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\in\\mathcal B\\Rightarrow F(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\simeq G(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle H_{\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x}\\rangle,\\vec x)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1952,"backlinks":[{"id":"0ebe52081fac785e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-real-substitution]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-real-substitution|thm-real-substitution — Substitution of a Computed Real]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","f3126eb15a4d7bf1"]}